{"id": "t078-001", "text": "so just got off the phone with sadia she's flying to lahore on the 14th of december for her cousin's wedding and um she's dreading the flight because it's like nine hours with a stopover in dubai and she gets really bad anxiety on planes, um she said her mum and her sister are going a week earlier on the 7th to help with the mehndi, i should send her a message the night before she flies just to say safe travels", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to lahore", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th of december", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the flight", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bad anxiety on planes", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week earlier", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mehndi", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before she flies", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t078-003", "text": "eli's off to japan next tuesday for two weeks he's been saving for it since like last year, he's doing tokyo first then kyoto and um maybe osaka at the end if he's got the money left, oh and he said his boss michael was really funny about signing off the leave so he's a bit stressed about work stuff piling up while he's away", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "since like last year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boss", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "michael", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit stressed about work stuff piling up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's away", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t078-005", "text": "kalani said her manager laura is leaving at the end of the month and nobody knows who's taking over the team, um she reckons it'll be callum which would be a disaster because they really don't get on, she's got a one to one with the director on wednesday to like put her name forward, need to ask her on thursday how that went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kalani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "laura", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "callum", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "don't get on", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one to one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "director", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her on thursday how that went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t078-007", "text": "lucy and her husband are doing the whole of italy in a camper van this summer they start in milan on the 2nd of june and um she said they'll end up in sicily by the 20th maybe the 21st depending on the ferry, and their kids are staying with lucy's mum the whole time which um apparently is a first, she's a bit worried about it to be honest", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "doing the whole of italy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of june", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the 20th maybe the 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole time", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t078-029", "text": "thomas said the team away day is off now um budget cuts apparently, he was gutted because he'd spent weeks organising it and um booked the venue and everything, and now he's got to tell the whole team on monday, so yeah, he was pretty down about it, maybe take him for a coffee next week", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tell the whole team", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty down", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t078-033", "text": "fiona's working from home most of the week now her boss finally said yes", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "working from home most of the week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t078-034", "text": "right so lucy's mum is turning seventy on the 5th of january and the family's doing a surprise lunch, lucy asked me to keep it quiet obviously, and um she mentioned her mum's been dropping hints about a new garden bench so maybe we chip in, also lucy's brother jamal is flying back from canada for it which is huge because he hasn't been home in like three years, should ask lucy how it went after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th of january", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a new garden bench", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jamal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from canada", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask lucy how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lucy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t078-038", "text": "jin's cat mochi went missing on the weekend, she's put posters up everywhere and been out every night with a torch calling for her, she's in bits honestly, her partner neha's been doing facebook groups and the vets um, should text her tomorrow and see if there's any news", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "jin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "neha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her tomorrow and see if there's any news", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
